export const SENSES=[{name:'Sight',verb:'See',color:'#96bcff',icon:'eye',items:['Circle','Star','Triangle','Square','Diamond','Moon','Heart','Cross']},{name:'Hearing',verb:'Hear',color:'#ecc779',icon:'ear',items:['Tap','Hum','Clap','Chime','Drum','Whistle','Snap','Ring']},{name:'Smell',verb:'Smell',color:'#b4d58c',icon:'nose',items:['Pine','Rose','Coffee','Mint','Rain','Orange','Lavender','Cocoa']},{name:'Taste',verb:'Taste',color:'#e6a1b4',icon:'tongue',items:['Sweet','Sour','Salty','Bitter','Savory','Tangy','Spicy','Fresh']},{name:'Touch',verb:'Touch',color:'#a7dcd2',icon:'hand',items:['Soft','Smooth','Rough','Fuzzy','Bumpy','Silky','Firm','Springy']}];
export const GATES=[4,8,12,16,20];
export const LAST=24;
export const TILE_POINTS=[0,10,10,5,10,5,5,5,10,5,5,5,10,10,15,15,10,15,20,25,10,20,30,25,10];
export const rewardAt=pos=>TILE_POINTS[pos]||5;
export function freshGame(names=['Blu','Ember']){return {version:1,players:names.map((name,i)=>({name:name.trim().slice(0,18)||['Blu','Ember'][i],score:0,pos:0})),active:0,phase:'roll',turn:1,energy:3,beacons:[false,false,false,false,false],lastRoll:null,log:['Welcome to the table. Blu and Ember start together.'],pending:null};}
export function movement(roll){if(!Number.isInteger(roll)||roll<1||roll>20)throw Error('Invalid d20');return Math.ceil(roll/5);}
export function senseAt(pos){return SENSES[(pos-1+5)%5];}
export function rollTurn(g,roll){if(g.phase!=='roll')throw Error('Not ready to roll');const p=g.players[g.active];if(p.pos===LAST)throw Error('Finished player cannot roll');let dest=Math.min(LAST,p.pos+movement(roll));const gate=GATES.findIndex((pos,i)=>!g.beacons[i]&&pos>p.pos&&pos<=dest);if(gate!==-1)dest=GATES[gate];p.pos=dest;g.lastRoll=roll;if(roll===20)p.score+=5;const landedGate=GATES.indexOf(dest);g.pending={gate,sense:landedGate!==-1?landedGate:(dest-1)%5};if(gate!==-1){g.phase='repair';}else if(dest===LAST){p.score+=10;g.phase='arrived';}else g.phase='choose';return {dest,gate,natural20:roll===20};}
export function chooseChallenge(g,level){if(g.phase!=='choose'||!['safe','bold'].includes(level))throw Error('Invalid challenge');g.pending.level=level;g.phase='challenge';}
export function resolveChallenge(g,correct){if(g.phase!=='challenge')throw Error('No challenge');const p=g.players[g.active],bold=g.pending.level==='bold';const before=p.score;p.score=Math.max(0,p.score+(correct?(rewardAt(p.pos)+(bold?10:0)):(bold?-5:0)));g.phase='result';return p.score-before;}
export function resolveRepair(g,correct){if(g.phase!=='repair')throw Error('No repair');if(correct){g.beacons[g.pending.gate]=true;g.players.forEach(p=>p.score+=10);g.phase='repaired';}else{g.energy--;g.phase=g.energy===0?'lost':'repair-failed';}}
export function retryRepair(g){if(g.phase!=='repair-failed')throw Error('No retry');g.phase='repair';}
export function recover(g){if(g.phase!=='roll'||g.energy>=3)throw Error('Cannot recharge');g.energy++;g.phase='recovered';}
export function nextTurn(g){if(!['result','repaired','arrived','recovered'].includes(g.phase))throw Error('Turn unfinished');if(g.players.every(p=>p.pos===LAST)&&g.beacons.every(Boolean)){g.phase='won';return;}let next=1-g.active;if(g.players[next].pos===LAST)next=g.active;g.active=next;g.turn++;g.pending=null;g.phase='roll';}
export function shuffled(items,rng=Math.random){return [...items].sort(()=>0).map(x=>({x,r:rng()})).sort((a,b)=>a.r-b.r).map(o=>o.x);}
export function makeChallenge(sense,level,rng=Math.random){const items=shuffled(SENSES[sense].items,rng).slice(0,level==='bold'?5:3);const index=Math.floor(rng()*items.length);return {items,index,options:shuffled(items,rng),answer:items[index]};}
export function makeRepair(gate,rng=Math.random){return {code:Array.from({length:4},()=>1+Math.floor(rng()*4)),gate};}
export function restoreGame(raw){try{const g=JSON.parse(raw);if(g.version!==1||!Array.isArray(g.players)||g.players.length!==2||!g.players.every(p=>typeof p.name==='string'&&Number.isInteger(p.score)&&p.score>=0&&Number.isInteger(p.pos)&&p.pos>=0&&p.pos<=LAST)||![0,1].includes(g.active)||!Number.isInteger(g.energy)||g.energy<0||g.energy>3||!Number.isInteger(g.turn)||g.turn<1||!Array.isArray(g.beacons)||g.beacons.length!==5||!g.beacons.every(x=>typeof x==='boolean'))return null;if(!['roll','choose','repair','challenge','result','repaired','arrived','recovered','repair-failed','lost','won'].includes(g.phase))return null;if(['choose','repair','challenge','repair-failed','result','repaired'].includes(g.phase)&&(!g.pending||!Number.isInteger(g.pending.sense)||g.pending.sense<0||g.pending.sense>4))return null;if(['repair','repair-failed'].includes(g.phase)&&(!Number.isInteger(g.pending.gate)||g.pending.gate<0||g.pending.gate>4))return null;if(g.phase==='challenge'){g.phase='choose';delete g.pending.level;}return g;}catch{return null;}}
